Common RequiredImmunization
    documentation "Stores the mandatory vaccinations or immunizations that students must have according to institutional or governmental regulations."
    descriptor ImmunizationType
        documentation "An indication of the type of immunization that an individual has satisfactorily received."
        is part of identity
    date ImmunizationDate
        documentation "The year, month and day of the related required immunization."
        is optional collection
    string MedicalExemption
        documentation "The medical condition identified by a physician that contraindicates the vaccine."
        is optional
        max length 1024
    date MedicalExemptionDate
        documentation "The year, month, and day of the medical exemption by a physician."
        is optional